For all who are wondering the speed mod codes work like this.
The speed of the fretboard and 3D characters are affected,
but the audio plays at normal speed. So the song is cut
short when the fretboard runs out if it is played with the
faster speed mods. If played with slo mo the audio will end
before the fretboard does.

